## File Structure

- `web/` - Web frontend (React/Next.js)
- `admin/` - Admin dashboard components
- `backend/` - Backend API (Node.js/Express)
- `shared/` - Shared styles and utilities
- `docs/` - Documentation
- `.backups/` - Backup files (automatically ignored by git)

